==Faroese==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈdɛavʊr]|lang=fo}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|dagr||day}}.

===Noun===
'''dagur''' {{m}}

# [[day]], the time between sunrise and sunset
# [[daylight]]
# day, 24 hours
# ({{p}}) [[life]], [[lifetime]]
# [[consciousness]]

====Declension====
{{fo-decl-noun-m42|d|a|g|e|ø}}

====Antonyms====
* {{sense|day}} [[nátt]]

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|daylight}} [[dagsljós]], [[dagslýsi]]
* {{sense|24 hours}} [[samdøgur]]
* {{sense|lifetime}} [[lív]], [[lívstíð]], [[æviskeið]]
* {{sense|consciousness}} [[vit]], [[tilvitska]]

